  "notes": {
    "title": "Full arena route and skill priority controls",
    "summary": "Pacing Prototype now has a six-arena Short run and a fifteen-arena Full run. Active skills show their priority and highlight where they will land when dragged.",
    "changes": [
      "Choose Full run in Developer Mode to fight through five dungeon tiers with a boss at the end of each tier.",
      "Arena enemies enter in formations from the right and approach the fight from their own lane. The hero starts on the left with a fixed arena camera.",
      "Drag active skills to change their casting priority. Numbered slots, a drag preview and a highlighted drop target show the new order.",
      "Fixed champion drag-and-drop setup in the Archive and made empty equipment slots non-interactive.",
      "Older run, trial and prototype checkpoints require a restart. Hero unlocks and remaining pulls stay available."
    ]
  }
}